# Brand Rules

## Heading Guidelines

All headings should follow these rules:
- **Font weight**: All headings must be in bold font
- **Capitalization**: Only the first letter of the first word should be capitalized, all other letters should be lowercase
- **Blog H2 headings**: Should use the Playfair font
- **Chapter breaks**: Should use a double line break in blog posts

### Examples

```html
<!-- Correct -->
<h1 style="font-weight: bold;">Main title</h1>
<h2 style="font-weight: bold; font-family: Playfair;">Section heading</h2>
<h3 style="font-weight: bold;">Subsection title</h3>

<!-- Incorrect -->
<h1>Main Title</h1>
<h2>Section Heading</h2>
<h3>Subsection Title</h3>
```

### CSS Implementation

```css
h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 {
  font-weight: bold;
}

/* Blog H2 headings with Playfair font */
.blog h2 {
  font-family: 'Playfair', serif;
  font-weight: bold;
}
```